### 1. Create Room
POST http://localhost:9501/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomName": "Test Room",
  "userId": "user123",
  "config": {
    "maxParticipants": 10,
    "recordingEnabled": false
  }
}


### 2. Join Room
POST http://localhost:9501/api/rooms/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "12168050-67e6-45f8-9dac-de8fda8b2c21",
  "userId": "user123"
}

### 3. Leave Room
POST http://localhost:9501/api/rooms/leave
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "c1bc6ad4-ad88-4467-a66b-1a5f52c3a67f",
  "userId": "user123"
}

### 4. SIP Call
POST http://localhost:9501/api/rooms/sip
Content-Type: application/json
X-Conference-Room: 1234
X-Conference-Server: janus.example.com

{
  "roomId": "c1bc6ad4-ad88-4467-a66b-1a5f52c3a67f"
}
